    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204">

                <pb facs="0216" n="204" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg204"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">822.24/459: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nester</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-02-06T14:00:00-05:00">February 6, 1943—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:02 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>105. For Parkhurst, Board of Economic Warfare, from Wilkinson.<anchor n="87"
                        xml:id="d204-f1"/> Embassy advises Decentralization Plan<anchor n="88"
                        xml:id="d204-f2"/> will be instituted in Ecuador March 1. The Country Agency
                    here will be prepared to start issuing Import Recommendations in accordance with
                    plan of procedure on that date.</p>
                <p>Please advise Embassy of the following: <list>
                        <label>(1)</label>
                        <item>Time schedule to be followed.</item>
                        <label>(2)</label>
                        <item>Target shipping tonnage to be used.</item>
                        <label>(3)</label>
                        <item>A recapitulation of the commodity estimates to be used as
                            targets.</item>
                        <label>(4)</label>
                        <item>A clear statement of the portion of the shipping estimate and each
                            commodity estimate to be set aside for projects.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <p>Materials lists for all projects approved should be sent as soon as possible.
                    [Wilkinson.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nester</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d204-f1" n="87" xml:id="d204-f1-content">
                <p>George V. Parkhurst and H. A. Wilkinson, officials of the Board of Economic
                    Warfare.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d204-f2" n="88" xml:id="d204-f2-content">
                <p>Decentralization Plan A; for an outline of the plan, see circular airgram of
                    January 19, 8 p.m., <ref target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
